 interrupts Old Cob's story by bringing a dead scrael to the inn; Kote recognizes that more of the creatures must be nearby.","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"snap-70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001-notw-char-bast","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","characterId":"notw-char-bast","eventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-waystone-inn","currentMapLayerId":"notw-map-waystone","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":1,"statusNotes":"Guards and assists Kote through A Place for Demons.","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"snap-70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001-notw-char-carter","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","characterId":"notw-char-carter","eventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-waystone-inn","currentMapLayerId":"notw-map-waystone","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":1,"statusNotes":"Carter interrupts Old Cob's story by bringing a dead scrael to the inn.","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"snap-70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001-notw-char-old-cob","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","characterId":"notw-char-old-cob","eventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-waystone-inn","currentMapLayerId":"notw-map-waystone","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":1,"statusNotes":"Watches familiar stories turn real at the Waystone during A Place for Demons.","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"snap-70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001-notw-char-graham","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","characterId":"notw-char-graham","eventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000001","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-waystone-inn","currentMapLayerId":"notw-map-waystone",