 the Chandrian","description":"Selitos founds the Amyr after cursing Lanre.","tags":["amyr","chandrian"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000026","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-ash-violent","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Denna's patron strikes her","description":"Denna's secret patron physically abuses her while controlling his identity.","tags":["denna","patron"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000091","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-auri-underthing","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Auri lives in the Underthing","description":"Auri secretly inhabits the buried spaces below the University.","tags":["auri","underthing"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000049","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-bast-fae","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Bast is Fae","description":"Bast only appears human and is vulnerable to iron.","tags":["identity","fae"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000004","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-bast-plan","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Bast arranged Chronicler's arrival","description":"Bast manipulated events so Kvothe would tell his story and recover himself.","tags":["frame","bast"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000092","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-ben-arcanist","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Abenthy is an arcanist","description":"Ben's skill is genuine University-trained magic.","tags":["identity","magic"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000008","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-blood-attack","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"The assassins tracked Kvothe through blood","description":"The alley attackers use a compass-like device keyed to Kvothe's blood.","tags":["sympathy","attack"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000069","originEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000069","createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-chandrian-real","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"The Chandrian are real","description":"The Chandrian are not merely children's superstition.","tags":["chandrian","secret"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000016","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-denna-alovine","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Denna is the singer Kvothe seeks","description":"The young woman from the caravan reappears at the Eolian and sings Aloine.","tags":["denna","identity"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000056","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-draccus","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"The beast is a drugged draccus","description":"The Trebon monster is a common draccus addicted to denner resin, not a dragon.","tags":["draccus","denner"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000076","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-four-plate","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"The Four-Plate Door is sealed","description":"An unexplained copper-plated stone door stands within the Archives.","tags":["archives","mystery"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"70000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000043","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1713200000000,"updatedAt":1713200000000},{"id":"kf-kote","worldId":"10000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000000","title":"Kote is Kvothe","description":"The quiet innkeeper is the legendary Kvoth